  "descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "Algorithmic Audit &amp; System Governance Registry - Exhibits\n\nThis private component contains forensic exhibits, retrieval logs, metadata contamination records, and source-grounded documentation related to public knowledge graph behavior, authorship attribution, structural misclassification, and commercial contamination involving the DHFT / Structural Stability Science corpus.\n\nMaterials include:\n\n* archived retrieval outputs,\n* metadata contamination examples,\n* attribution failures,\n* gender-routed classification errors,\n* fabricated synthesis events,\n* and related structural analysis records.\n\nThis component is maintained as a restricted archival and evidentiary surface and is not part of the primary public-facing scientific corpus.\n\nAccess is limited.\n\nResearchers, counsel, institutional reviewers, or parties with a legitimate professional interest may request access directly through OSF messaging or by contacting the project administrator.\n\nRequests should include:\n\n* full name,\n* institutional or professional affiliation,\n* reason for access request,\n* and intended use context.",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
  ],
